The embedded pronunciation data (cmudict_data.mbt, generated from
data/upstream/cmudict-0.7b) is from the CMU Pronouncing Dictionary,
Copyright (C) 1993-2015 Carnegie Mellon University. It is distributed under
its own permissive license (see data/README.md and data/upstream/cmudict-0.7b
header). Use of the dictionary for any research or commercial purpose is
completely unrestricted; acknowledgement of its origin is requested.

The API design follows Allison Parrish's `pronouncing` (Python, MIT) and the
CMUdict data format. ARPABET-to-IPA mapping follows the standard CMU/IPA
correspondence.